# Testing

## Levels

- Unit: business logic, validation, mappers, URL/filter parsers
- Component: UI states and interactions (RTL)
- Integration: critical journeys across frontend and verified backend contracts

## Must cover when relevant

Happy path + failures: authz, empty states, invalid input, unavailable data, localization, mobile, payment failure, duplicate events.

Reusable UI: zero / one / many records, missing media, long translated text, loading/empty/error, keyboard/a11y.

## Hard rules

- Never remove, weaken, skip, or `--passWithNoTests` to make CI green.
- Test fixtures stay in test code only.
- Prefer behavior assertions over implementation details.

## Commands

```bash
npm run test
npm run test:coverage
npm run check
```
